---
/**
 * The Last Stop wordmark, matching the game's start screen (src/style.css,
 * `#start-overlay h1`): "LAST STOP" in Helvetica Neue ExtraBold, lightly tracked.
 */
---

<span class="lw">LAST STOP</span>

<style>
  .lw {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
</style>
